            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "In your setup keys 'N' and 'P' are missing in `query_updaters`. That is why they don't act like query updaters.\r\n\r\nAlso 'j', 'k', 'n', 'p' are missing.\r\n\r\nAdd them and it should work.",
